# PSR-4a — Denali export classification + deprecation map

## Scope

| Work | In this wave | Deferred to PSR-4b+ |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Classify all Denali `package.json` exports | Yes (162) | — |
| Publish deprecation cohorts | Yes | — |
| Delete / move / rename exports | **No** | After compatibility window |
| API branded-import neutrality | **No** | PSR-4b |
| Product-default / codegen neutrality | **No** | PSR-4b |

Machine map:
[`psr-4a-denali-export-classification.yaml`](./psr-4a-denali-export-classification.yaml)

Encapsulation covenant:
[`docs/dev/denali-plugin-encapsulation.mdoc`](../../dev/denali-plugin-encapsulation.mdoc)

## Taxonomy (SoT §PSR-4)

| Class | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| `public-contract` | `.`, `./plugin`, manifest-bound `./settings/*`, `./theme/*` |
| `host-private` | `./host/*` consumed by hosts, packages, scripts, or manifest/codegen |
| `test-only` | External consumers are tests only |
| `compatibility` | Transitional alias (none in this snapshot) |
| `product-internal` | No external consumer found — **shrink candidate** (not proof of dead code) |

## Snapshot metrics (2026-07-31)

| Class | Count | Target |
| --- | ---: | ---: |
| `public-contract` | **14** | ≤15 public |
| `host-private` | **39** | ≤30 host-visible |
| `test-only` | 29 | move/fixture later |
| `product-internal` | 80 | primary shrink pool |
| **Total** | **162** | — |

| Gap | Value |
| --- | ---: |
| Public over budget | **0** |
| Host-visible over budget | **9** |

Reference surfaces: Urban=18, Harbor=9, starter=5, guest-club=10.

## Deprecation map (cohorts)

| Status | Count | Intent |
| --- | ---: | --- |
| `retain-public` | 14 | Keep; already within ≤15 |
| `retain-host-visible` | 39 | Keep for now; peel −9 in PSR-4b |
| `move-candidate` | 29 | Prefer fixture / smoke isolation |
| `shrink-candidate` | 80 | Stop exporting after re-verify (manifest, sync script, dynamic) |

**Important:** `product-internal` / `shrink-candidate` is a **discovery class**, not
removal approval. Many paths may still be reached via relative imports inside
Denali or future manifest entries. Removal requires per-export proof.

## Method

1. Read `packages/workspaces/denali/package.json` `exports` keys (162).
2. Scan repo for `@app-tour/workspace-denali/<subpath>` consumers (excluding
   Denali `dist/`).
3. Cross-link `workspace.manifest.json` path strings to export keys.
4. Assign class + deprecation cohort per taxonomy above.

Validator:

```bash
node scripts/ops/psr-4a-export-classification-smoke.mjs
```

## Exit gate

| Check | Result |
| --- | --- |
| Every Denali export has exactly one class | required |
| Classes ⊆ SoT taxonomy | required |
| No `package.json` export keys added/removed | required |
| Targets + gaps documented | required |
| Harbor/Urban counts recorded as reference | required |

## Next (PSR-4b)

API/codegen/product-default neutrality; begin host-visible contraction (−9) and
test-only moves **only** with per-export consumer proof — not bulk delete.
